# Demo requests: keep this file up to date with your actual API.
# Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension or IntelliJ's HTTP client.
# Alternatively, replace it with a curl script; anything we can replay quickly.

# Adjust if you changed the port mapping in docker-compose.yml.
@host = http://localhost:8000

### Health / smoke
GET {{host}}/

### Trigger ingestion (adjust to your design: endpoint, CLI, …)
# POST {{host}}/ingest

### List contracts
GET {{host}}/contracts

### Contract detail incl. claims
GET {{host}}/contracts/ELV-100234

### List claims
GET {{host}}/claims

### Decide the sanity-anchor claim (expected: APPROVED, payout 1652.31)
POST {{host}}/claims/778120/decision

### Deciding again returns the same decision (idempotent)
POST {{host}}/claims/778120/decision
